msgstr "Stor (max bredd = 440px)"

#. A configuration option set by the website's developer - not an end-user facing string.
#: fc-loan-calculator.php:1188
msgid "Load custom style sheet?"
msgstr "Ladda in anpassade stilmallar?"

#. The negative answer to a binary question.
#: fc-loan-calculator.php:1190
#: fc-loan-calculator.php:1357
#: fc-loan-calculator.php:1366
#: fc-loan-calculator.php:1377
#: fc-loan-calculator.php:1386
msgid "No"
msgstr "Nej"

#. The positive answer to a binary question.
#: fc-loan-calculator.php:1191
#: fc-loan-calculator.php:1358
#: fc-loan-calculator.php:1367
#: fc-loan-calculator.php:1378
#: fc-loan-calculator.php:1387
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Ja"

#. A configuration option set by the website's developer - not an end-user facing string.
#: fc-loan-calculator.php:1195
msgid "If \"Yes\" loads &lt;site&gt;\\wp-content\\plugins\\ac-loan-calculator\\css\\accurate-calculators-custom.css. Entries in <b>accurate-calculators-custom.css</b> override the plugin's look. Editing the provided custom stylesheet is another way to modify the look of the calculator. For best performance include only the rules in the custom stylesheet you are overriding. BACKUP YOUR CUSTOMIZATIONS! You will need to manually replace them when (if) you upgrade the plugin."
msgstr "Om \"Ja\" laddas &lt;site&gt;\\wp-content\\plugins\\ac-loan-calculator\\css\\accurate-calculators-custom.css. Innehållet i <b>accurate-calculators-custom.css</b> ersätter utseendet på pluginet. Att redigera den tillhandahållna anpassade stilmallen är ett annat sätt att ändra kalkylatorns utseende. För bästa prestanda, inkludera endast de regler du ersätter i den anpassade stilmallen. SÄKRA DINA ANPASSNINGAR! Du måste manuellt ersätta dem när (om) du uppgraderar pluginet."

#. A configuration option set by the website's developer for setting the websites default currency symbol - not user facing.
#: fc-loan-calculator.php:1201
msgid "Set a default currency?"
msgstr "Ange en standardvaluta?"

#. A configuration option set by the website's developer - not an end-user facing string.
#: fc-loan-calculator.php:1203
msgid "Use visitor's browser's settings to set currency - do not override."
msgstr "Använd besökarens webbläsarinställningar för att ställa in valuta - åsidosätt inte dessa."

#. A configuration option set by the website's developer - not an end-user facing string.
#: fc-loan-calculator.php:1327
msgid "Set a date format convention?"
msgstr "Ange en datumformatkonvention?"

#. A configuration option set by the website's developer - not an end-user facing string.
#: fc-loan-calculator.php:1329
msgid "Use visitor's browser's settings to set date format - do not override."
msgstr "Använd besökarens webbläsarinställningar för att ställa in datumformatet - åsidosätt inte detta."

#. An instruction or clarification for the website's administrator - not end-user facing.
#: fc-loan-calculator.php:1341
msgid "When a user first visits your site, the plugin will use the browser's international conventions to set the currency and date format. If you wish, you may override the plugin and set a default currency and date format. The user will still have the ability to override either setting if you do not hide the &quot;international conventions&quot; below."
msgstr "När en användare besöker din webbplats för första gången, kommer pluginet att använda webbläsarens internationella konventioner för att ställa in valuta- och datumformat. Om du vill kan du åsidosätta pluginet och ställa in en standardvaluta och ett standarddatumformat. Användaren kommer fortfarande att kunna ändra dessa inställningar om du inte döljer \"internationella konventioner\" nedan."

#. An instruction or clarification for the website's administrator - not end-user facing.
#: fc-loan-calculator.php:1346
msgid "<strong>Note:</strong> Your visitors may select a date format and currency by clicking on <span class=\"red\">$ : MM/DD/YYYY</span> in the calculator's lower right corner if you do not set \"Hide international conventions\" to \"yes\"."
msgstr "<strong>Obs:</strong> Dina besökare kan välja ett datumformat och valuta genom att klicka på <span class=\"red\">$ : MM/DD/YYYY</span> i kalkylatorns nedre högra hörn om du inte ställer in \"Dölj internationella konventioner\" till \"ja\"."

#. A configuration option set by the website's developer - not an end-user facing string.
#: fc-loan-calculator.php:1355
msgid "Hide the resize buttons?"
msgstr "Dölj knapparna för att ändra storlek?"

#. A configuration option set by the website's developer - not an end-user facing string.
#: fc-loan-calculator.php:1364
msgid "Hide international conventions?"
msgstr "Dölj internationella konventioner?"

#. A configuration option set by the website's developer - not an end-user facing string.
#: fc-loan-calculator.php:1375
msgid "Hide the Payment Method?"
msgstr "Dölj tidpunkt för betalning?"

#. Inital part of a string asking site's administrator if they want to "link to" another site. Administrator will answer 'Yes' or 'No'.
#: fc-loan-calculator.php:1384
msgid "Link to"
msgstr "Länk till"

#. An instruction or clarification for the website's administrator - not end-user facing.
#: fc-loan-calculator.php:1396
msgid "If \"Link to AccurateCalculators.com\" is set to \"Yes\", one very discreet follow link will be inserted in the calculator. If you allow the link, you may rebrand the calculator with your name. Resetting this option to \"No\" at any time will remove the links. See FAQ's in readme file for details."
msgstr "Om \"Länk till AccurateCalculators.com\" är inställd på \"Ja\" kommer en mycket diskret länk att infogas i kalkylatorn. Om du tillåter länken kan du rebranda kalkylatorn med ditt namn. Om du när som helst återställer detta alternativ till \"Nej\" kommer länkarna att tas bort. Se FAQ i readme-filen för detaljer."

#. A prompt asking site's administrator for their brand name.
#: fc-loan-calculator.php:1401
msgid "Add Your Brand Name"
msgstr "Lägg till ditt varumärke"

#. An instruction or clarification for the website's administrator - not end-user facing.
#: fc-loan-calculator.php:1405
msgid "You may brand this widget with your brand. <b>Example: \"Abe's Best\"</b> will be preappended to \"Loan Calculator\". For this to work, the above \"Link to\" option must be set to \"Yes\"."
msgstr "Du kan märka denna widget med ditt varumärke. <b>Exempel: \"Abe's Best\"</b> kommer att läggas till framför \"lånekalkylator\". För att detta ska fungera måste alternativet \"Länk till\" ovan vara inställt på \"Ja\"."

#. A prompt for the site's developer instructing them to set a site-wide default value for a user entered value. Not user facing.
#: fc-loan-calculator.php:1416
msgid "Default loan amount"
msgstr "Standardlånebelopp"

#. A prompt for the site's developer instructing them to set a site-wide default value for a user entered value. Not user facing.
#: fc-loan-calculator.php:1422
msgid "Default number of months"
msgstr "Standardantal månader"

#. A prompt for the site's developer instructing them to set a site-wide default value for a user entered value. Not user facing.
#: fc-loan-calculator.php:1429
msgid "Default interest rate"
msgstr "Standardränta"

#. An instructional or clarification message concerning data entry requirements.
#: fc-loan-calculator.php:1435
msgid "Enter only digits.<br>No currency or formatting."
msgstr "Ange endast siffror.<br>Ingen valuta eller formatering."

#. A sectional label on a settings page for administrator settings that impact style.
#: fc-loan-calculator.php:1445
msgid "Style options."
msgstr "Stilalternativ."

#. An instructional message to the site's administrator explaining setting website color option.
#: fc-loan-calculator.php:1447
msgid "(Defaults in parentheses. \"hex\", \"rgb\", or \"rgba\" values accepted for colors.)"
msgstr "(Standardvärden inom parentes. \"hex\", \"rgb\" eller \"rgba\"-värden accepteras för färger.)"

#. An instructional message for administrator settings.
#: fc-loan-calculator.php:1571
msgid "You may tweak the minimum and maximum widths."
msgstr "Du kan justera de minsta och största breddmåtten."

#. An instructional message for administrator settings.
#: fc-loan-calculator.php:1573
msgid "(\"px\", \"rem\", and \"em\" units accepted.)"
msgstr "(Enheter \"px\", \"rem\" och \"em\" accepteras.)"

#: fc-loan-calculator.php:1656
msgid "AC Loan Calculator by AccurateCalculators.com"
msgstr "AC Lånekalkylator av AccurateCalculators.com"

#: fc-loan-calculator.php:1658
msgid "AC Loan Calculator Plugin"
msgstr "AC Lånekalkylator-plugin"

#. Plugin Name of the plugin/theme
msgid "AC Loan Calculator"
msgstr "AC Lånekalkylator"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin/theme. Do not translate the URL.
msgid "https://accuratecalculators.com/calculator-plugins/loan-plus-plugin"
msgstr "https://accuratecalculators.com/calculator-plugins/loan-plus-plugin"

#. Description of the plugin/theme
msgid "A versatile loan calculator with an amortization schedule, payment dates, and interactive charts. Rebrand with your name. Supports 90 currencies, 6 date formats, and 15 languages. Highly customizable via extensive configuration options. Version 2.0 is a major update—test before upgrading."
msgstr "En mångsidig lånekalkylator med amorteringsschema, betalningsdatum och interaktiva diagram. Rebranda med ditt namn. Stöder 90 valutor, 6 datumformat och 15 språk. Mycket anpassningsbar via omfattande konfigurationsalternativ. Version 2.0 är en stor uppdatering—testa innan uppgradering."

#. Author of the plugin/theme Do not translate the domain.
msgid "AccurateCalculators.com"
msgstr "AccurateCalculators.com"

#. Author URI of the plugin/theme. Do not translate the URL.
msgid "https://AccurateCalculators.com"
msgstr "https://AccurateCalculators.com"

